## Whole-file declarations, data, registration and contextual obligations (unit-1)

On body load, this manual drag-and-drop fixture selects all children of the first paragraph (Drag me). A 350px by 150px object embeds helper-scroll-then-drop-input.xhtml as application/xhtml+xml. The helper places an input below a large margin in the embedded scroll area. The user drags the selected text toward the bottom, waits for scrolling, and drops into the input; the helper instructions expect a copy of the selection in that input. This page has one inline load handler and no callable declarations.


